Robert,
 
The box that you have is most likely a Professional 300 series 
personal minicomputer (either a 350 or a 380).
 
The Professional ran a series of operating systems, including 
P/OS (and RSX-11M-PLUS variant), RT-11, and various others.
 
The base P/OS distribution should be available from DECUS. I do 
not have current information about the other systems.
 
The systems are nice, at least for their time (no fancy graphics, 
but, if you can make use of a personal PDP-11, they are 
reasonable).
 
