It's the direct ancestor of the software that nails down two megabytes
of main memory on every Alpha, never to give it back...

It was very fruitful, its descendants are numerous and diverse...  In
fact, when encountering two modern examples of the species, you may
wonder if they are even related at all!

So, next time you sit at a newly booted Alpha, and are staring at 
the '>>' on the screen, think of that humble console box, neglected
perhaps, but not forgotten.  It may not be of much use these days, 
but fear not, it shall never disappear entirely, since its spirit
has entwined itself into the very heart of the DEC engineering 
genome, never to depart...

