and VAX/VMS environments - with both Xterm and DECterm windows.
I've learned how to set the DECterm titlebar and iconnames, then
realized it's different from what Xterm expects.  For example,

Xterm	uses	=> ESC]2;mySpecialTitleCTRL-g

DECterm	uses	=> ESC]21;mySpecialTitleESC\

	Since I'm accessing VMS logins from both SUN/Xterm
