|>attack on the Storage Works RAID that CRN had in for its product
|>review, as described in last week's issue?  Has DEC suspended shipments 
|>of its RAIDs, and, if so, what is going on?  What's the timeframe for
|>ECOs to correct the problems?  Is there going to be a press release
|>on this to explain what is going on?  If not, why not?  What's Palmer's
|>position on this?
