the server and port # which your modem is located on.
You also have to set the port on your DS200 to REMOTE access so it can be 
accessed either way.

You can also define a service on your decserver with a name like DIALOUT,
and you can then do a set host/lat DIALOUT.
(EG: define service dialout port 3 ident "DIALOUT").
Make sure your modem port is set to remote access too.

