Nah, the problem was that the HELP was dreadful and the manuals weren't much
better.  The HELP is much better in V5.8 than it was in Extensions -- they have
reorganized it according to command syntax rather than the object hierarchies,
which makes it a lot easier for me and, I suspect, most people to understand. 
