If the application is in Fortran, they can use the CONVERT='BIG_ENDIAN'
option in the OPEN statement which will cause DEC Fortran to automatically
do the byte-swap on input or output.  Otherwise it should be a straightforward
task to write a program to process the file and do the byte swap as
necessary.
