: Can I setup the VT220, such that F11 (or any other F key) will produce
: ESC even _if_ VT220 is in VT220 mode?

You can program any function key to produce ESC, but only shifted. In other
words, you can make SHIFT-Fn send ESC.  Some others have suggested trying
F11; this is because many applications take the CSI 23~ sent by F11 to mean
the same as ESC; however, the hardware itself cannot be made to send ESC
with a single key press (which is what you want).

