The answer is to buy a 4-pole switch/button from an electronics store and 
wire it up between the contacts on the mouse connector and the ribbon 
inside the housing.  Or have wires hanging out and simply twist them 
together when needed (not recommended)

Don't forget to set CMOS mouse connected to *none*

